sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant Envoy as Envoy Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant EPP as EPP (ext-proc)<br/>9002/TCP gRPC
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ModelSrv as Model Server<br/>HTTP/HTTPS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over Client,ModelSrv: Flow 1: Synchronous Inference (Gateway Mode)
        Client->>Envoy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+, Gateway Auth
        Envoy->>EPP: ext-proc callout (gRPC)<br/>Optional TLS
        Note over EPP: Score endpoints via<br/>KV-cache locality, load,<br/>priority plugins
        EPP->>K8s: Watch CRDs & Pods<br/>ServiceAccount Auth
        K8s-->>EPP: Resource state
        EPP-->>Envoy: Routing decision<br/>(selected endpoint)
        Envoy->>ModelSrv: Forward request<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
        ModelSrv-->>Envoy: Inference response
        Envoy-->>Client: JSON/SSE response
    end

    participant Coord as Coordinator<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant RenderSvc as Rendering Service<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant IGW as Inference Gateway<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant Redis as Redis<br/>6379/TCP

    rect rgb(245, 240, 255)
        Note over Client,Redis: Flow 2: Disaggregated E/P/D (Coordinator)
        Client->>Coord: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Configurable TLS
        Coord->>RenderSvc: Tokenize request<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
        RenderSvc-->>Coord: Tokenized payload
        Coord->>IGW: Encode request<br/>HTTP, Configurable TLS
        IGW-->>Coord: Encode result
        Coord->>IGW: Prefill request<br/>HTTP, Configurable TLS
        IGW-->>Coord: Prefill result
        Coord->>IGW: Decode request<br/>HTTP, Configurable TLS
        IGW-->>Coord: Decode stream
        Coord-->>Client: SSE stream response<br/>Configurable TLS

        Note over Coord,Redis: Async Mode (optional)
        Coord->>Redis: Enqueue async request<br/>TCP (no encryption)
        Client->>Coord: GET /v1/requests/{id}<br/>Poll for result
        Coord->>Redis: Fetch result
        Redis-->>Coord: Stored result
        Coord-->>Client: Async response
    end

    participant Sidecar as Sidecar<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    participant PrefillW as Prefill Worker<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    participant DecodeW as Decode Server<br/>8200/TCP HTTP

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note over IGW,DecodeW: Flow 3: Sidecar Disaggregated P/D
        IGW->>Sidecar: Inference request<br/>HTTP, Configurable TLS
        Sidecar->>PrefillW: Prefill coordination<br/>HTTP/HTTPS, Configurable TLS
        PrefillW-->>Sidecar: Prefill + KV-cache metadata
        Note over Sidecar: KV-cache transfer<br/>(NIXL RDMA / Shared Storage / SGLang)
        Sidecar->>DecodeW: Forward decode request<br/>HTTP (no TLS)
        DecodeW-->>Sidecar: Inference result
        Sidecar-->>IGW: Response
    end
